        <definition id="oval:mil.disa.stig.windows2025:def:278165" version="1" class="compliance">
          <metadata>
            <title>WN25-DC-000340 - The Windows Server 2025 "Access this computer from the network" user right must only be assigned to the Administrators, Authenticated Users, and Enterprise Domain Controllers groups on domain controllers.</title>
            <affected family="windows">
              <platform>Microsoft Windows Server 2025</platform>
            </affected>
            <description>Inappropriately granting user rights provides system, administrative, and other high-level capabilities.

  Accounts with the "Access this computer from the network" right may access resources on the system, and this right must be limited to those requiring it.</description>
          </metadata>
